{"3603860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beach Bar Simulator", "steam_appid": 3603860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603860/extras/ccd7ce29e189ff242485db356a23242a.avif?t=1780918291\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, expand, and customize your beach bar freely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve dozens of drinks and foods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare every order manually with realistic systems </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage customers, chaos, and satisfaction </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with <strong>2–6 players in co-op</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603860/extras/3a2dad0adde6619c745547c077e9d356.avif?t=1780918291\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the bar together with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide tasks: mixing drinks, serving food, controlling customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication is key — mistakes lead to chaos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player directly affects the bar’s success</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603860/extras/458acaad78e76f03528c27a6efac44a3.avif?t=1780918291\" width=780 height=84 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your bar in <strong>any direction you want</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design layout, decorations, fences, and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class